{"id":"vod_sn_39185","vodId":"39185","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"模型姐妹","name_cn":"模型姐妹","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1b33b5dc7b5c8a5c8f0d8ff307be8648.jpg"},"summary":"源间色枝（狩野茉莉 配音）拥有着一副萝莉般的矮小身材，却意外的在槌球和将棋方面有着出色的天赋。个性活泼的她喜欢开玩笑，为了捉弄人，她也是蛮拼的。冈本（内山夕实 配音）留着蘑菇头，因此被源间嘲笑为“河童”，平日里温文尔雅的她，被惹恼后便会化身为可怖的修罗，除此之外，她的“战斗力”亦十分可观。酒巻真希菜（井上麻里奈 配音）个性温和，虽然常常被取笑，但却并不会真正生气。　　以上三人均为模型社的社员，可是，除了真希菜外，似乎并没有人真正对模型有什么兴趣。三个古灵精怪的女孩，以及她们的模型社，充满了欢笑和刺激的日常在这里展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kisGpUKt661/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zXtRdQnczP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2zxDR2hGmX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QfgwRVkwyr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C1smJjCuUm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2Zsz5E4w3k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cvc0L0FAvY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pvzW3DFs4S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EfZAF5ZNb01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2zxpN7Utea1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ejgR27fqkQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZsCzhbymRP1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:49.494Z"}